pulsaros-airpods (0.2.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * The extension now reads the state of the pulsaros-librepods daemon (Apple
    Accessory Protocol): listening modes, adaptive level, Conversation Awareness,
    One-Bud ANC, ear detection, AirPods Pro 3 and Max 2
  * Low-battery notifications at 20, 10 and 5 percent
  * The Python daemon and its D-Bus service are removed; the package is the
    extension only and depends on pulsaros-librepods

 -- Victor Rosario <hello@victorrosario.dev>  Wed, 04 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000

